*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W0118900                                              *        
*                                                                               
*  FUNKTION   :  FIND UPDATED ORDER CONFIRMATIONS                               
*                BY MATCHING THE CURRENT Q1 UNLOAD WITH                         
*                THE PREVIOUS Q1 UNLOAD . ALL NEW AND CHANGED                   
*                RECORDS SHOULD BE SENT TO DATALAKE                             
*                                                                               
*  FÖRFATTARE :  PRIYA RC                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W01189D1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%WDQ101EX 'INCURR-'                                                             
                                                                                
FILE W01189D2                                                                   
*                                                                               
%WDQ101EX 'INPREV-'                                                             
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W01189D3 FB(419 0)                                                         
*                                                                               
%WDQ101EX 'OUT-'                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
*                                                                               
* STEG 1. MATCH TO FIND NEW RECORDS ON CURRENT FILE TO SEND TO VSIM             
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W01189D1  KEY(INCURR-WDQ101EX)  +                                    
           W01189D2  KEY(INPREV-WDQ101EX)  +                                    
          )                                                                     
                                                                                
   IF MATCHED                                                                   
   ELSE                                                                         
      IF W01189D1                                                               
         OUT-WDQ101EX      = INCURR-WDQ101EX                                    
         PUT W01189D3                                                           
      END-IF                                                                    
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
